config DRM_GS101
	tristate "DRM support for Google gs101 (Tensor G1)"
	depends on DRM && OF
	depends on ARCH_EXYNOS || COMPILE_TEST
	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
	help
	  Display support for the Google gs101 SoC used in Pixel 6.

	  This is work in progress: the DECON display controller driver
	  currently only maps its registers and acquires its clocks, then
	  fails probe. It does not produce a picture. Enable it to verify
	  that cmu_dpu hands out the display clocks.

	  If M is selected, the module will be called gs101-drm.
